    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n40 Seabury Park is a fantastic part red brick double-fronted home featuring beautiful upgraded pvc double-glazed windows and an inviting layout designed for comfortable family living. \n\nExtending over 140sqm the property boasts bright and spacious accommodation throughout comprising of a spacious living room/dining space highlighted by a charming bay window and a cozy fireplace, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere. Adjacent to the living room, you'll find a versatile playroom or study, a guest w.c is located under the stairs. Beyond the hallway is a homely kitchen with dining space perfect for family gatherings and a convenient utility space, offering additional storage and functionality. A conservatory leads out to the rear garden with extensive patio, barna style shed and low maintenance artificial lawn. \n\nThe upper level has five spacious bedrooms including a generous master suite with fitted wardrobes and en-suite and 4 further bedrooms, a family bathroom and extra shower space. \n\nThis property is perfect for families looking for a spacious and functional home with modern comforts in a prime location close to all amenities including local schools, sports facilities, Malahide Castle to name just a few."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 1.52m x 1.04m\nTiled porch with upgraded double glazed sliding door\n\nHall - 4.45m x 1.67m\nWooden flooring with under stairs wc\n\nKitchen/Breakfast area - 6.34m x 2.53m\nKitchen with ample floor and wall units, high quality integrated appliances, Whirlpool oven and hob, extractor fan, sink unit, double glazed window to rear, large skylight, tiled floor, breakfast area, opening to utility area\n\nLounge/Dining Room - 4.66m x 3.48m\n+ 3.71m x 2.62m Wooden flooring throughout, large bay window to front, French doors to sun room\n\nFamily Room - 5.20m x 2.20m\nWooden flooring, storage closet, large double glazed window to front\n\nStorage - 0.96m x 0.81m\n\n\nUtility Room - 3.56m x 2.22m\nAmple storage space, plumbed for washing machine, storage cupboard/pantry\n\nSun room - 2.66m x 2.53m\nTiled floor, sliding doors to rear\n\nLanding - 2.88m x 1.87m\nCarpet landing with skylight\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.91m x 3.36m\nBuilt in wardrobes, wooden flooring, double glazed window to rear\n\nEnsuite - 2.54m x 0.82m\nTiled ensuite comprising of shower, hand wash basin, wc and frosted window\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.92m x 2.79m\nSliderobes, double glazed window to front, wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.52m x 2.16m\nBuilt in wardrobes, double glazed window to front, wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.93m x 2.45m\nWooden flooring, double glazed window to front, built in wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 2.88m x 2.55m\nFully tiled bathroom comprising bath with shower, hand wash basin, wc and frosted window\n\nBedroom 5 - 2.83m x 2.18m\nBuilt in wardrobes, double glazed window to rear, wooden flooring\n\nShower Room - 1.26m x 0.75m\nShower, skylight\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Fantastic spacious double fronted family home.</li><li> Five bedrooms </li><li> Part red brick</li><li> Large driveway</li><li> Upgraded windows</li><li> Upgraded insulation in attic</li><li> Porch to front</li><li> Just minutes from local schools, shops, sport facilities and Malahide Village with its host of amenities</li><li> Close to all transport links including the M1, M50 and Dublin Airport</ul>"
      },
